            <ArticleTitle>Pregabalin for fibromyalgia: some relief but no cure.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>255-61</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3949/ccjm.76a.08024</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>What is the role of pregabalin (Lyrica) in the treatment of fibromyalgia? In this article the authors explore the putative pathophysiology of fibromyalgia, pregabalin's mechanism of action and evidence of efficacy, and its emerging role in treating this challenging disease.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
